156
00:33:12.040 --> 00:33:23.700
Toni Wahrstaetter: then it would actually start fixing any invariant. In this case, invariant 3, which is a failed gas, hands-back state gas, which is exactly this try-catch pattern we have been discussing.

157
00:33:24.120 --> 00:33:32.749
Toni Wahrstaetter: So, it feels like if we want to tackle the gas left issue, then we have to move to the right-hand side of this chart.

